  "notes": "YuE2 Style Variants -> YuE2GenerateABC (list) -> YuE2 Auto-Arrange -> YuE2GenerateMusic. Same plan seed + lyrics for every plan; Auto-Arrange relabels sections so the render has no voice. The render seed drives YuE2GenerateMusic and KSampler: keep the plan seed and change it for new renders of the same score. Song Variety Report checks the result (no automatic retries here; YuE2 Varied Song does those)."
